' Shishoza — UPDATED Architecture (adds email service + monitoring log to serving pipeline)
@startuml Shishoza_Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Offline training pipeline" {
  [GEE export] --> [Feature build]
  [Feature build] --> [Train Random Forest]
  [Train Random Forest] --> [rf_D.pkl]
}

package "Online serving pipeline" {
  [Browser\n(Citizen / Manager)] --> [Flask API]
  [Flask API] --> [Risk / Neighbourhood / Simulation services]
  [Flask API] --> [Review Controller]
  [Review Controller] --> DB
  [Review Controller] ..> [Email / SMTP service] : async notify
  [Flask API] ..> [predictions_log.csv] : monitoring log
  [Risk / Neighbourhood / Simulation services] --> [rf_D.pkl]
  [Risk / Neighbourhood / Simulation services] --> [Google Earth Engine]
  database "SQLite\n(USERS, CITIZENS, REQUESTS,\nSIMULATION_RUNS, ALTERNATIVES,\nANALYSIS_CACHE)" as DB
}

note bottom of [Email / SMTP service]
  NEW vs report: +Email/SMTP notification service (async, off request thread)
  and +predictions_log.csv monitoring store; +auth & review endpoints.
end note
@enduml
